# External corpus — reconstitute with fetch_corpus.sh. Shallow clones of the
# projects listed in issue #1181, used to rank which Tcl commands the AOT WASM
# backend should emit directly. Hundreds of megabytes; never committed.
aplsimple/
eda/
georgtree/
nico-robert/
tcltk/

# Regenerated by fetch_corpus.sh on every run (resolved clone heads and sizes),
# so tracking it would leave the checkout dirty after each reconstitution. The
# revisions the committed census was computed from are recorded in the design
# doc's corpus table instead: docs/design/compiler/aot-command-priority.md.
provenance.txt
